        "sid": "RUT 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomi wakadi ne muikulu wa mu tshiota tshia bayandi, Elimeleke, muntu mukole ne mubanji, dina diandi Boaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luta, Muena Moaba, wakambila Naomi ne, Anji kuitabusha bua meme kuya mu budimi bua undi mua kusangana luse ku mesu kuandi bua meme kuhumbululaku mpumbuluila Yeye wakamuambila ne, Yaku, muanʼanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakaya mu budimi, wakahumbulula mpumbuluila mu budimi ku nyima kua banowi, ku mpukahuka yeye wakabuela mu tshituha tshia budimi bua Boaza wakadi wa mu tshiota tshia Elimeleke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boaza wakalua mufume ku Beteleheme, wakambila banowi ne Yehowa ikale nʼenu, bobo bakamukudimuna ne, Yehowa akusankishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Boaza wakakonka muena mudimu wandi wakadi ku mutu kua banowi ne, Nsongakashi eu ngua nganyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muena mudimu wakadi ku mutu kua banowi wakamukudimuna ne, Yeye udi nsongakashi, Muena Moaba, wakahingana ne Naomi, balue ku buloba bua Moaba; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yeye wakungambila ne, Ndi nkusengelela, anji kuitabusha bua meme kuhumbulula mpumbuluila ku nyima kua banowi munkatshi mua bisumbu bia orge, nunku yeye wakalua wakashala diandi to ne katataka, anu hakayeye mu nsubu tshituha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Boaza wakambila Luta ne, Muanʼanyi, kuena munvue, anyi? Kuyi bua kuhumbulula mpumbuluila mu budimi bukuabo, kumuki kunoko nansha, kadi ushale ne bakashi benji banyi ba mudimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesu ebe ikale ku budimi budibo banowa, ubalonde, meme tshiakamana kudimusha bansongalume ne, Kanumulengi bianza, anyi? Biakusuma nyota, uye biebe ku milondo ya mai, unue mai akasunabo kudi bansongalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakakuma mpala wandi hanshi, wakamukukuila, wakamukonka ne, Meme nakasangana luse ku mesu kuebe bualu kai bua wewe wakunjingulula wakuntangila, meme muenyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boaza wakamu kudimuna ne Bakamana kungambila malu onso awakenzela mamuenʼebe ku nyima kua lufu lua bayebe, ne bu muwakalekela tatu webe ne mamu webe ne buloba buakakulelabo, wa kalua kudi bantu baudi kuyi muji ngulule diambedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa akufute bua mudimu webe, bakuhe difutu diebe dionso kudi Yehowa, Nzambi wa Isalele, uwakulua kuso koma muinshi mua mahuahua andi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakamba ne, Mukelenge wanyi, nsangane luse ku mesu kuebe, bualu bua wewe wakunsamba, wakuambila mukashi muenji wa mudimu webe mei a kalolo, tshiakadi kuikala bu umue wa bena mudimu bebe bakashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafika diba dia kudiabo bidia, Boaza wakamuambila ne, Lua kunoko, udie bidia, utue tshihesa tshiebe mu vinaigre. Yeye wakashi kama luseke lumue ne banowi, bakamulesha mateta akamanabo kukanga, yeye wakadia, wakukuta, wakashiya makuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakabikeye bua kuhumbulula mpumbuluila, Boaza wakambila bansongalume bandi ne, Nuitabushe bua yeye ahumbulule mpumbuluila munkatshi mua bisumbu bia orge mene, kanumukandi nansha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bukuabo, numuhatuile orge mikuabo mu bisumbu nuyishiye hanshi, bua yeye ayihumbulule, kanumukandi nansha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku yeye wakahumbulula mpumbuluila mu budimi to ne ku dilolo, ne yeye wakashehula bintu biakahumbululeye, biakadi bu épha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.17:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Epha wakadi tshihiminu tshia bintu biume tshia litres 37.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wa orge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamuambula, wakaya mu musoko, mamuenʼandi wakatangila biakahumbululeye yeye wakahatula, wakamuha biaka shiyeye hakukuteye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mamuenʼandi wakamukonka ne, Wakahumbulula mpumbuluila kudi kunyi lelu? Wakenza mudimu kudi kunyi? Mu ntu au wakakujingulula ikale biandi ne disanka Yeye wakamanyisha mamuenʼandi ne, Muena kunakadi wenza mudimu lelu wakadi Boaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomi wakambila mamuenʼandi ne, Yehowa udi kayi ulekela kalolo kandi kudi badi ne muoyo ne badi bafue amusankishe. Naomi wakamuambila ne, Muntu au udi wa ha buihi nʼetu, udi umue wa mu tshiota tshietu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luta, Muena Moaba wakamukudimuna ne, Bulelela, yeye wakungambila ne, Wewe ulamate bansongalume banyi to ne hashikishabo kunowa bintu bianyi bionso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naomi wakambila Luta, ma muenʼandi, ne, Bidi bimpe, muan a nyi, bua wewe uluhuke ne bakashi benji ba mudimu bandi, kabakusa nganyi mu budimi bukuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "RUT 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nu nku yeye wakalamata bakashi benji ba mudimu ba Boaza to ne kunshiki dilu kua kunowa kua orge ne blé yeye wakashikama ne mamuen andi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
